.TH "WHATSMYIP.SH" "1" "November 2026" "arran4/dotfiles" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
whatsmyip.sh \- report the publicly observed IPv4 and IPv6 addresses
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBwhatsmyip.sh\fR
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Query ipv4.icanhazip.com and ipv6.icanhazip.com using curl, wget or dig fallbacks. Print IPv4 and IPv6 results separately, displaying Unavailable if either request fails.
.SH NOTES
Addresses are obtained through external network services and may reflect a VPN, proxy, or NAT egress address rather than a local interface.
